<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">申请开通账号</view>
    <view class="desc">
      当前微信账号还未开通权限。请填写姓名后提交申请，等待管理员审核。
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">姓名</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="请输入姓名，最多10个字"
        maxlength="10"
        value="{{name}}"
        bindinput="onNameInput"
      />
    </view>

    <button
      class="submit-btn"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      bindtap="submitApplication"
    >
      提交申请
    </button>
  </view>
</view>